  "steps": [
    "Cut the tofu into finger-thick slices, then cut each slice into 4.",
    "Mix the marinade in a wide dish, add the tofu and marinate at least 30 minutes, turning a few times.",
    "Set up three plates: cornstarch with salt and pepper; aquafaba; panko with both sesames.",
    "Coat each piece in cornstarch, dip in aquafaba, then press into the sesame crust.",
    "Bake, air-fry or pan-fry until golden and crisp."
  ],
  "notes": "Homemade chickpea cooking water should be reduced by half before using."
